{; One model reply, as text, and the ordered form SOURCES read out of it.
 ; Sources are strings, not forms: the stored source is exactly what the
 ; agent wrote (comments and all), and the evaluator parses inside its
 ; own armed context — parsing twice on two readers is how a `#=` scar
 ; comes back.
 :seon.cluster.reply/sources [:vector [:string {:min 1}]]
 :seon.cluster.reply/text :string}
